  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"ko\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\"\r\n          content=\"width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\r\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"\">\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"\">\r\n    <title>NEXON</title>\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/font.css?v=NGiusjaubt6kJGb9y2Lh4WCHRM6Bh60fSk2INjmd-9k\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/popup/print.css?v=VXaB7GIOYTUrCG3lwjWTFYSk-YjJSMwIy8eeEhuthaE\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/popup/help_reset.css?v=XRyu8WDNySejkhgR3yBgmCCu1SnOFlDH7jfJZDS_Kp0\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/popup/help_common.css?v=w7mfcf9tjo0eiYox72W72IIyUmVgTSgA1TveRB1ZCi8\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/popup/help_popup.css?v=d9LBmodKicEIJN5FHO7OR2KrAEC9blnbEtsxXAczUmE\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/popup/all.css?v=Rj_XxbEqEHYDIHQBuoS8p2Upeg0-eyoXa8LInP3ORJ4\">\r\n    <script src=\"/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js?v=82hEkGrSMJh3quMSG4f7FbngmAPLTDM63H4eNayS4Us\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\r\n    <script src=\"/js/helpboardInquiry/common.js?v=FNnuGm-gkPnrq9jANKsrfrEX4TL3JHTM0i7uExPTELk\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\r\n    <script src=\"/js/commonDefine.js?v=9Rw-UkNV_lRFLnb_yV6fGKgdPKn5MvWXai_yJEV11vo\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://ssl.nexon.com/s1/da/a2s.js\"></script>\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/js/utils/a2s.js?v=632lGCVpQZwC_lTIH7v-xaj5aTLnLu1a5n23kIbq7tA\"></script>\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        var setA2SLog = function(){\r\n            const object = 'HelpBoard_popup';\r\n            const a2sValue = {\r\n                HelpID: 5408,\r\n                LoginType: 0,\r\n                UniqueVisitor : '220.126.96.88',\r\n                AltGroup: 'etc',\r\n                Prime: \"n\",\r\n                AltChanneling: 'nexon',\r\n                GameCode: '127'\r\n            };\r\n\r\n            const hasMID = 127 == GAMECODE_DNF || 127 == GAMECODE_CYPHERS;\r\n            if(hasMID) {\r\n                a2sValue.MID = 0 > 0 ? 0 : undefined;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            SetContentsLog(object, JSON.stringify(a2sValue));\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        var viewPopup = function () {\r\n            $(\"#close1\").click(function (e) {\r\n                e.stopPropagation();\r\n                window.close();\r\n            });\r\n            $(\"#close2\").click(function (e) {\r\n                e.stopPropagation();\r\n                window.close();\r\n            });\r\n            $(\"#close3\").click(function (e) {\r\n                e.stopPropagation();\r\n                window.close();\r\n            });\r\n            $(\"#close4\").click(function (e) {\r\n                e.stopPropagation();\r\n                window.close();\r\n            });\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        $(document).ready(function () { \r\n            setA2SLog();\r\n            viewPopup(); \r\n\r\n            let tables = document.getElementsByTagName('table');\r\n            for (let i = 0; i < tables.length; i++) {\r\n                let table = tables[i];\r\n                if (table) {\r\n                    let node = document.createElement('div');\r\n                    node.className = 'tableContainer scroll';\r\n                    table.parentNode.insertBefore(node, table);\r\n                    node.appendChild(table);\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        });\r\n    </script>\r\n</head>\r\n<body class=\"index_page_body\">\r\n    <div class=\"dimm\">\r\n        <img src=\"/image/common/blank_size_100.png\" alt=\"\">\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div id=\"wrap\" class=\"index_page_wrap\">\r\n        <div id=\"header\" class=\"game_help_header\">\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"help_popup_wrap\">\r\n            <div class=\"popup_bx\">\r\n                <div class=\"help_pop_head\">\r\n                    <h1 id=\"title\" class=\"tit\">&#xC544;&#xC774;&#xD15C;&#xC774; &#xC0AC;&#xB77C;&#xC84C;&#xC5B4;&#xC694;.</h1>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"help_pop_content\">\r\n                    <div id=\"text\" class=\"terms_bx_2\">\r\n                        <!-- image or text -->\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"tbl_col\">\r\n                            <img id=\"previewImage\" src=\"\" alt=\"your image\" class=\"nexon-hide\">\r\n                            <div id=\"Content\"><div class=\"se-contents\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;; font-size: 14px;\" data-document-padding-top=\"18\" data-document-padding-left=\"23\" data-document-padding-right=\"23\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">▶ 던파ON을 통한 아이템 확인하기</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">모험가님 아이디 내 소지하고 있는 아이템들은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0);\">(우편함 제외)</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">던파ON 어플리케이션&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(0, 0, 205); background-color: rgb(255, 215, 0);\">내 아이템</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">&nbsp;기능을 통해 검색/확인하실 수 있습니다!!</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 259px; height: 316px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"https://help.nexon.com/image/Help/d224c054f8cb4519a58b13b6c58ef870.png\"></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">*&nbsp;[던파ON] 2024년 11월 28일 업데이트 :</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\" data-href=\"https://df.nexon.com/community/news/update/2845952\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_9d50583d-845e-4619-8ca9-b0d9d2d2deba\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://df.nexon.com/community/news/update/2845952\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">[바로가기]</span></a><br><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">* [던파ON] 다운로드 경로 :</span><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\" data-href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=kr.co.neople.dfon\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_b2c27cb6-8daa-4e7e-ba91-d4187b70517f\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=kr.co.neople.dfon\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">[ Android ]</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\" data-href=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/deonpaon/id1191261065\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_14cc0b21-ca41-4ef7-a0d6-2e913060c6ad\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/deonpaon/id1191261065\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">[ IOS ]</span></a><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">1) 아이템 검색</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(76, 81, 88);\">서버별 캐릭터가 보유하고 있는 아이템들의 위치를 한 번에 확인 가능&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0);\">(우편함 제외)</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 540px; height: 356px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"https://help.nexon.com/image/Help/503bf487938341cb91d92569c233f7dc.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">2) 삭제 아이템</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 49, 61);\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(76, 81, 88);\">모든 캐릭터가 보유하고 있는 기간제 아이템들의 정보를 한 번에 확인 가능&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 128, 0);\">(우편함 제외)</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 278px; height: 355px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"https://help.nexon.com/image/Help/2a06440cd3354b8a81a394301c19591b.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">▶ 던파ON을 통해 해결되지 않는 경우</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>만약, 위 방법을 통해 해결되지 않으신다면</span><br><span>아래 유형들에 해당하는 것은 아닌지 확인 부탁 드립니다.</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(HOT!!) [내금고 II]에 보관된 아이템 확인하기!!</span><br><span>→&nbsp;</span><a style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 63, 199);\" data-href=\"https://df.nexon.com/df/news/update?p=web&amp;mode=view&amp;no=2662106\" data-hyperlink-id=\"se_6e4e4b1e-73af-4de7-a443-a5be702a8cba\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://df.nexon.com/df/news/update?p=web&amp;mode=view&amp;no=2662106\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">4/28(목) 정기점검으로 [내금고 II]가 추가</span></a><span>되었습니다.</span><br><span>[내금고 I]이 아닌&nbsp;[내금고 II]에 보관신 것은 아닌지 살펴주세요!!</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">1) 일시적인 아이템 사라짐 현상 (장비, 큐브 조각 등)</span><br><span>→ 채널/캐릭터를&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">다시 선택</span><span>하여 ID 정보를 갱신해주세요.</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">2) 게임 내 검색 기능(돋보기) 활용하기</span><br><span>① 캐릭터/계정금고 검색하기</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 268px; height: 103px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"http://help.nexon.com/image/Help/db67090d01dc46c4a011ccc9ab7c7e16.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>②&nbsp;캐릭터 인벤토리 검색하기</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 254px; height: 117px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"http://help.nexon.com/image/Help/40e9558b97fe4adc9054d8ae8da70854.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">3. 상점 판매 및 마을 드랍(버리기) 확인하기</span><br><span>→ NPC 상점 내 재구입 탭 보관 여부 체크</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 384px; height: 324px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"http://help.nexon.com/image/Help/e53aaa9452a74320acbf8f6cdc4c9a20.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">4. 캐릭터 아이템 퀵슬롯 확인하기</span><br><span>→ 게임 내 좌측 하단의 아이템 퀵슬롯 체크</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 217px; height: 81px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"http://help.nexon.com/image/Help/3be8161281c841b68ae767177f125967.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">5. 세라샵 인벤토리 확인하기</span><br><span>→ 세라 아이템은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">[세라샵 인벤토리]</span><span>에 우선 보관되며,</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">세라샵 인벤토리에서 구매를 확정해야 인벤토리로 지급</span><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 194px; height: 163px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"https://help.nexon.com/image/Help/500255a977614c98812fbad69a4d9d83.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">※ 세라샵 인벤토리는 캐릭터마다 다르게 적용되어</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;다른 캐릭터의 세라샵 인벤토리도 꼭 확인해주세요!!</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">6. 우편함 확인하기</span><br><span>→ 게임 내 우측 하단의 우편물 UI가 표기되어 있을 경우,</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; 우편함으로 이동하여 도착한 우편물 수령</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span class=\"se-drawing-object-wrapper se-image\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; display: inline-block;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 253px; height: 251px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px;\" src=\"http://help.nexon.com/image/Help/27d51283dc0f41b9b3b31880b30463fc.png\"></span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;- - -&nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;위 안내로도 아이템이 확인되지 않는 경우에는</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">아래의 기재양식을 작성하여 문의글 접수</span><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;부탁드립니다.</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">[ 기재사항 ]</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>1. 서버/캐릭터명 :</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>2. 발생 일시 :</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>3. 유실된 아이템명 : (정확하게 기재해주세요.)</span><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>4. 상세 내용 :</span></p></div></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"window.close()\" title=\"닫기\" class=\"btn_close\" id=\"close4\">\r\n                    <img src=\"/image/common/btn_close.png\">\r\n                </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"footer\" class=\"game_help_footer\">\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
}
